WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.380
The two color yarn changer requires three

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:07.780
parts the front bed extension,
the two color changer,

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:13.820
also called a feed box and the curved
cam inserted in the back bed

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:15.420
main rail.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.420
The first thing to recognize is

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:21.740
that the fasteners that attach
the extension plate are in two parts.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:25.100
There's a threaded post
and a threaded nut.

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:29.940
If you remove the nut, sometimes
the threaded post will also be removed.

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:32.860
Use a screwdriver to separate them. First

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:39.240
install the front bed extension
with the threaded post and nut.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:46.140
If you already had a four color changer
installed, remove the three part curved

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:51.860
cam and replace it with the single
bed curved cam underneath the bed.

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:57.540
Removed the threaded post
and threaded nuts from the back bed.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:00.020
Slip the color changer over the posts

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:06.410
that are in place in the bed
and secure them with the wing nut.

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:09.980
With this color changer,
you'll be able to quickly change colors

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.360
without having to rethread
your machine each time.

